WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.080
FSDV15 claims 25 times better handling of safety critical cases as it begins early rollout. This

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:14.040
is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 673. Korea's auto trade with China, cybertruck safety engineering,

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:19.360
an optimus hardware hiring come next, with a compute efficiency segment and the weekend

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:25.580
review after that. Tesla posted the full, full self-driving, or FSD version 15 release

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:31.340
notes on X, upgrading the vision encoder that Robotaxi and Optimus also use after it

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.480
trained on millions of videos from the internet.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:39.000
Tesla Reality View builds a live generative picture from a virtual camera above the car,

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.260
and marks planned turns and parking with arrows and pins.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:47.560
And drivers can run it full screen, split it with the map, or let the map take over.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:52.800
Root choice now trains end-to-end on fleet preferences at the beginning and end of trips.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:58.240
And once you arrive, the map can show several parking options that FSD uses parking history

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.020
to help pick.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:05.500
Detection improves for signs, animals, debris, potholes, standing water and chains, with

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:10.880
slowing for speed cameras, bike rack mode for hitch accessories, more natural speeds in

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:14.620
school zones and bad weather, and avoidance of deep standing water.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:19.620
The new follow camera shows where the car is going and what is around it in a grand theft

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:25.740
auto, or GTA-style view, replacing an earlier parking display that only drew outlines of nearby

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:31.380
objects with a real-time recreation of the street. The same release adds a quieter cabin mode,

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:37.768
and turn signal audio fades after a few clicks. South Korea's auto-trade gap with China,

00:01:38.248 --> 00:01:45.528
Seoul economic daily found, was led by Chinese built Tesla vehicles to 4.23056 billion dollars in

00:01:45.528 --> 00:01:52.468
the January October period, up 92.7% from a year earlier. New Tesla registrations in

00:01:52.468 --> 00:02:02.268
Korea reached 98,313 units, up 105% and the Model Y accounted for 78,631 of them as the

00:02:02.268 --> 00:02:09.568
top-selling imported model. Chinese electric vehicles or EVs now hold 33.9% of Korea's

00:02:09.568 --> 00:02:16.508
EV market, up from 1.1% in 2021, and among the world's 10 largest auto-producing countries,

00:02:16.748 --> 00:02:21.008
only Mexico and Brazil posted bigger increases in Chinese EV penetration.

00:02:21.748 --> 00:02:29.428
Imports of Chinese automobiles rose 79.2% to 4.39033 billion dollars, while exports to

00:02:29.428 --> 00:02:34.488
China fell 34.9% to 168.77 million dollars.

00:02:34.488 --> 00:02:39.588
The automotive trade deficit with China came to about $6 trillion in that January

00:02:39.588 --> 00:02:40.628
October window.

00:02:41.068 --> 00:02:47.388
Already past last year's full-year deficit of $2.51162 billion, and it marks a tenth

00:02:47.388 --> 00:02:49.688
straight year of deficits since 2017.

00:02:50.548 --> 00:02:55.628
BYD sold more than 20,000 units over the same stretch, and industry voices are growing

00:02:55.628 --> 00:03:00.688
louder for a broad inclusion of electric vehicles in the domestic production tax credit to protect

00:03:00.688 --> 00:03:02.408
the country's manufacturing base.

00:03:02.408 --> 00:03:10.034
Cybertruck earned a 5-star safety rating, car buzz confirmed, and a 2.6 seconds 0-60 time.

00:03:10.554 --> 00:03:15.874
A 48-volt electrical architecture cuts wiring weight, and structural battery pack integration

00:03:15.874 --> 00:03:20.594
plus steer-by-wire with rear wheel steering are the standout engineering choices.

00:03:21.354 --> 00:03:27.414
News Nation data ranks Cybertruck as the fastest-selling used truck, with resale velocity outpacing

00:03:27.414 --> 00:03:34.021
other truck models in the tracked period. Tesla Reality View, Tesla Roddy Reports, runs on half

00:03:34.021 --> 00:03:40.041
of one trip accelerator in the AI4 computer, and generates photo-realistic output directly from

00:03:40.041 --> 00:03:45.441
the end-to-end driving model without a game engine. Textures land in enough detail that it is

00:03:45.441 --> 00:03:50.141
hard to believe a drone is not following the car, and the right side of the comparison uses

00:03:50.141 --> 00:03:55.601
less compute than the older wireframe side used to take. The feature is expected to reach hardware

00:03:55.601 --> 00:04:03.715
for HW-4, cars with the newer AMD Ryzen processor first. Optimus motor, power electronics

00:04:03.715 --> 00:04:10.035
and actuator rolls are open at Tesla, TeslaNorth.com reports, with the postings aimed at hardware

00:04:10.035 --> 00:04:15.015
for the next generation of the robot. Canada now carries an 8-year emissions performance

00:04:15.015 --> 00:04:22.035
warranty for 2027 Model 3 and Model Y vehicles, drive Tesla Canada reports, covering battery

00:04:22.035 --> 00:04:23.995
and drive-unit emissions performance.

00:04:24.455 --> 00:04:30.255
A California driver tested Mercedes-assisted driving against Tesla FSD, Supercar Blonde

00:04:30.255 --> 00:04:35.215
reports, with differences in lane-centering and adaptive cruise response on local roads

00:04:35.215 --> 00:04:37.775
and unexpected behavior in real-world driving.

00:04:38.415 --> 00:04:43.395
Italy authorized Tesla's assisted driving system for supervised operation on public roads,

00:04:43.875 --> 00:04:49.335
Yahoo! autos reports, ahead of broader European Union or EU approval and nearly doubling

00:04:49.335 --> 00:04:50.895
the EU population covered.

00:04:50.895 --> 00:04:56.515
Tesla has started emailing invites for its December 3rd shareholder meeting at Gigatexus,

00:04:56.935 --> 00:05:03.395
not a Tesla app reports, with board elections and a vote on 2025 executive compensation on the agenda.

00:05:04.055 --> 00:05:08.875
Hamilton Ontario now has an upgraded version for Supercharger at CF Lime Ridge,

00:05:09.215 --> 00:05:12.975
with extra stalls and higher power capability live for local owners.

00:05:13.938 --> 00:05:18.318
Powerwall owners sit in more than 100 virtual power plant programs worldwide.

00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:24.158
Mario Knawfall set on X, sending stored home energy back to the grid during peak demand.

00:05:24.598 --> 00:05:29.358
Mario Knawfall put it that power plants used to need smoke stacks and now they need a garage.

00:05:30.631 --> 00:05:35.231
Elon Musk posted a direct comparison of supervised FSD to that video game,

00:05:35.651 --> 00:05:38.971
and drivers can swing a virtual camera around the car while the system

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:43.751
generates the scenery in real time. Elon Musk also said adding radar would

00:05:43.751 --> 00:05:47.731
reduce effective signal-to-noise ratio in the current camera-based approach.

00:05:47.731 --> 00:05:53.691
Elsewhere, Tesla's VP of AI confirmed reality view replaces explicit model signals with

00:05:53.691 --> 00:05:58.571
a single-generative view that streams from an arbitrary virtual camera above the vehicle.

00:05:59.171 --> 00:06:04.591
A cybercab manual update outlines first responder procedures, points to highway speeds and

00:06:04.591 --> 00:06:10.191
owner-operated units, suggests possible California expansion, and hints at broader deployment

00:06:10.191 --> 00:06:12.411
options beyond initial-limited areas.

00:06:12.411 --> 00:06:18.263
Imports from China now sit 26 times larger than Korean auto exports the other way,

00:06:18.703 --> 00:06:25.163
JKN reports, and Tesla registrations represent over 30% of Korea's imported passenger car market.

00:06:25.803 --> 00:06:31.183
BYD surpassed 20,000 new registrations in the same window after entering that market last year.

00:06:32.221 --> 00:06:35.541
Six trip cores make up the neural side of the AI4 computer,

00:06:35.941 --> 00:06:39.901
which puts the new view at roughly one-twelfth of available neural capacity,

00:06:40.421 --> 00:06:42.821
rather than competing directly with driving inference.

00:06:42.821 --> 00:06:48.341
That lower demand leaves headroom for extra perception work, including finer reads on road

00:06:48.341 --> 00:06:51.581
hazards or more frequent preference updates pulled from the fleet.

00:06:52.201 --> 00:06:57.721
The same model weights feed Robotaxi and Optimus training pipelines, so any cut in visualization

00:06:57.721 --> 00:07:01.221
overhead scales across three programs without new silicon.

00:07:02.061 --> 00:07:06.581
Vertical integration of the training data, the model architecture, and the inference hardware

00:07:06.581 --> 00:07:11.781
lets Tesla measure and trim that overhead in one closed loop instead of negotiating across

00:07:11.781 --> 00:07:17.341
separate suppliers. The result is a measurable drop in watts per rendered frame, which improves

00:07:17.341 --> 00:07:22.601
margin on every supervised mile driven today, and every unsupervised mile planned for later.

00:07:23.241 --> 00:07:27.601
Generating the whole scene from the driving model itself, rather than a separate rendering

00:07:27.601 --> 00:07:33.101
engine, removes a translation layer between perception and output. Because the markers for

00:07:33.101 --> 00:07:37.321
plan turns and parking spots come from the same neural weights that control the vehicle,

00:07:37.321 --> 00:07:41.461
The picture stays synchronized with actual intent without extra engineering.

00:07:42.181 --> 00:07:46.301
That is also why the new view can look more detailed than the old wire frames while

00:07:46.301 --> 00:07:47.601
using fewer resources.

00:07:48.341 --> 00:07:52.741
Fleet data that trains those start and end root preferences flows into the same model,

00:07:53.121 --> 00:07:57.241
so the visualization benefits from collective learning without a separate map stack.

00:07:57.921 --> 00:08:02.221
When that learning later stretches across the full root, the same efficiency advantage

00:08:02.221 --> 00:08:03.861
applies over longer distances.

00:08:03.861 --> 00:08:07.061
For customers, the practical difference is in the cabin.

00:08:07.581 --> 00:08:12.601
You can watch the plan unfold with photorealistic clarity, and still know the system is not burning

00:08:12.601 --> 00:08:15.581
extra cycles that could have gone to safety critical detection.

00:08:16.301 --> 00:08:20.981
Over time, the lower compute cost per frame should translate into either longer range on the

00:08:20.981 --> 00:08:25.161
same battery, or room to run more background tasks without a hardware change.

00:08:25.801 --> 00:08:30.521
That margin compounds across the supervised fleet and carries forward when unsupervised

00:08:30.521 --> 00:08:32.601
operation begins in regulated markets.

00:08:32.601 --> 00:08:32.781
units.

00:08:33.582 --> 00:08:40.142
The base model Y Tesla stretched by 27 miles earlier this week still lists at $41,630

00:08:40.142 --> 00:08:45.782
for 348 miles of range, and that was only the opening move in a busy 7 days.

00:08:46.502 --> 00:08:51.422
Owners then gained a path to put model Ys on Tesla's Robotaxi network as soon as December.

00:08:52.062 --> 00:08:58.142
Tesla also showed power core, packing a 7.4 megawatt solid-state transformer, inverter

00:08:58.142 --> 00:09:05.042
and breaker into one oil-free unit rated at 98.86% peak efficiency for 2027 operation.

00:09:05.842 --> 00:09:11.982
North American owners began receiving FSD version 14.3 in regular software updates rather than

00:09:11.982 --> 00:09:18.062
waiting for a dedicated track. Before we go, those gigatexas shareholder invites now in inboxes

00:09:18.062 --> 00:09:23.222
point at December 3rd for the next dated vote. That covers it for today's Tesla developments.

00:09:23.222 --> 00:09:32.422
T.S.L.A. closed Friday at $345.82, down $28.59, or 7.6%.

